{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/lightmyfire_desc.gif?t=1742830571\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursed Companions is a co-op horror game that uses voice control or speech recognition to listen to every word the players are saying. So what you <strong>say</strong> can save or sabotage your team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/healfriends_desc.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you say the <i><strong>right</strong></i> words, and you can cast spells or heal your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/hurtthem_desc.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when you say the <strong><i>wrong</i></strong> words (i.e. &quot;Follow me!&quot;) you could wipe out your team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/procedural_dungeons.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeons are <strong>procedurally-generated</strong>, every run is a brand-new experience. The dungeons go deeper as the game progresses, so try not to get lost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/spooky_monsters.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Dark Queen assures you that all dungeon creatures are safe and cuddly. Just try not to aggravate them. From monsters that hunt by sound to ones that you have to shoo away by yelling, there\u2019s always a way to survive your wildlife experience.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f<strong>NOTE: Players are limited to 3 in-game days for Demo.</strong> \u26a0\ufe0f</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/traitor_mode.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you're done being nice and &quot;teamworky&quot;, it's time to take things to another level with the Traitor Mode. Traitors have the two special abilities: see the health and death curses of the Companions <i>and</i> give death curses to anyone. Find the Traitors before they take you out. Call for an 'Emergency Meeting' and vote the Traitor out! </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/banner_cursedtreasures.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/pick_up_cursed_treasure_720.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the dungeons and seek Treasure for the Dark Queen. But beware, for these Treasures are <i><strong>cursed</strong></i> with forbidden words that will hurt you if they are spoken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring the Treasures home for the Dark Queen, and you will gain her favor. But if you don\u2019t collect enough Treasure\u2026 the consequences are dire.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, you must <i><strong>always</strong></i> meet the target!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/banner_makeahouseahome.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look out for loot along the way \u2014 selling them will allow you to buy equipment and upgrade your skills. And with enough gold, you and your companions can turn your humble hearth into a tasteful mansion!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/01.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/banner_cursingatyourcompanions.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Communication is key to Cursed Companions \u2014 what you say or <i><strong>don\u2019t </strong></i>say to each other will determine the success or failure of your mission. And don\u2019t forget, the <i><strong>real </strong></i>treasure was the friends we made along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/02.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/keyfeatures.png?t=1742830571\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speech Recognition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is 'always listening', the game uses voice-activation game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Say the right words to get ahead </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your voice to light your torch, to disable traps or shoo monsters away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Say the wrong words to your peril</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your voice can awaken monsters, hurt you and even your teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Dungeons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every run is a brand new experience. The dungeons go deep, so try not to get lost!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo, Co-op or Versus Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 8 players for co-op mode, and an 8 vs 8 for teamplay mode. Play solo if you dare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade and get better</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exchange Loot for gold to buy equipment like the Teleport Stone, various potions and more. Doll up your house with furniture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary wildlife </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters guard that which you seek. Know their quirks, use stealth or your wits, or just sacrifice your teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>See how far you and your team can go </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no end. Keep playing on and on if you can. Once you die, you start over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Language Mod Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently only supports <u>English</u>. But will provide easy instructions to add your own language using alternative language voice models.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/roadmap.png?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These are the major upcoming features we're working on (in no particular order):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team Versus Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to change costumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locked Rooms / Keys mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements and Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitch Integration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400570?t=1742830571","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742830571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/53674bb7fccb6aac3c8f26e96922d8e50cac1c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742830571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/53674bb7fccb6aac3c8f26e96922d8e50cac1c2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742830571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/lightmyfire_desc.gif?t=1742830571\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursed Companions is a co-op horror game that uses voice control or speech recognition to listen to every word the players are saying. So what you <strong>say</strong> can save or sabotage your team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/healfriends_desc.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you say the <i><strong>right</strong></i> words, and you can cast spells or heal your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/hurtthem_desc.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when you say the <strong><i>wrong</i></strong> words (i.e. &quot;Follow me!&quot;) you could wipe out your team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/procedural_dungeons.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeons are <strong>procedurally-generated</strong>, every run is a brand-new experience. The dungeons go deeper as the game progresses, so try not to get lost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/spooky_monsters.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Dark Queen assures you that all dungeon creatures are safe and cuddly. Just try not to aggravate them. From monsters that hunt by sound to ones that you have to shoo away by yelling, there\u2019s always a way to survive your wildlife experience.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f<strong>NOTE: Players are limited to 3 in-game days for Demo.</strong> \u26a0\ufe0f</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/traitor_mode.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you're done being nice and &quot;teamworky&quot;, it's time to take things to another level with the Traitor Mode. Traitors have the two special abilities: see the health and death curses of the Companions <i>and</i> give death curses to anyone. Find the Traitors before they take you out. Call for an 'Emergency Meeting' and vote the Traitor out! </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/banner_cursedtreasures.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/pick_up_cursed_treasure_720.gif?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the dungeons and seek Treasure for the Dark Queen. But beware, for these Treasures are <i><strong>cursed</strong></i> with forbidden words that will hurt you if they are spoken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring the Treasures home for the Dark Queen, and you will gain her favor. But if you don\u2019t collect enough Treasure\u2026 the consequences are dire.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, you must <i><strong>always</strong></i> meet the target!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/banner_makeahouseahome.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look out for loot along the way \u2014 selling them will allow you to buy equipment and upgrade your skills. And with enough gold, you and your companions can turn your humble hearth into a tasteful mansion!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/01.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/banner_cursingatyourcompanions.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Communication is key to Cursed Companions \u2014 what you say or <i><strong>don\u2019t </strong></i>say to each other will determine the success or failure of your mission. And don\u2019t forget, the <i><strong>real </strong></i>treasure was the friends we made along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/02.jpg?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/keyfeatures.png?t=1742830571\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speech Recognition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is 'always listening', the game uses voice-activation game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Say the right words to get ahead </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your voice to light your torch, to disable traps or shoo monsters away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Say the wrong words to your peril</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your voice can awaken monsters, hurt you and even your teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Dungeons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every run is a brand new experience. The dungeons go deep, so try not to get lost!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo, Co-op or Versus Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 8 players for co-op mode, and an 8 vs 8 for teamplay mode. Play solo if you dare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade and get better</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exchange Loot for gold to buy equipment like the Teleport Stone, various potions and more. Doll up your house with furniture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary wildlife </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters guard that which you seek. Know their quirks, use stealth or your wits, or just sacrifice your teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>See how far you and your team can go </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no end. Keep playing on and on if you can. Once you die, you start over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Language Mod Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently only supports <u>English</u>. But will provide easy instructions to add your own language using alternative language voice models.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/extras/roadmap.png?t=1742830571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These are the major upcoming features we're working on (in no particular order):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team Versus Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to change costumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locked Rooms / Keys mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements and Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitch Integration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["Crimson Forge Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3265230","name":"Cursed Companions"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400570/header.jpg?t=1742830571","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Crimson Forge Studios","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099710,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099710/movie480.mp4?t=1740239664","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099710/movie_max.mp4?t=1740239664"},"name":"Cursed Companions Latest Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099710/42fd48f9d5ea0e8f1d16a8b22dc4e52df4d75f3d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740239664","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099710/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740239664","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099710/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740239664"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257112937,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112937/movie480.mp4?t=1741694638","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112937/movie_max.mp4?t=1741694638"},"name":"Traitor Mode Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112937/6e77bdbe33c282984167c1435710f3af3799d5ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741694638","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112937/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741694638","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112937/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741694638"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257082538,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082538/movie480.mp4?t=1739890840","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082538/movie_max.mp4?t=1739890840"},"name":"Cursed Companions Trailer and Gameplay (2024)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it